<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-RGC to buy Peru copper/gold project.</title>
<headline>RTRS-RGC to buy Peru copper/gold project.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mineral sands and metals miner RGC Ltd said on Tuesday it had agreed to pay up to US$37 million for a copper/gold project in Peru.</p>
</text>
